      "zh": "Windows / macOS 独立浏览器登录、多账号、动态模型与额度。无需外置反代服务。",
      "en": "Standalone Doubao Work provider with isolated browser sign-in and per-account models and usage."
    },
    "maxConcurrency": 1,
    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,"
